e information strictly required.</p><h4>7.- Security measures</h4> <p>The Property adopts all the necessary technical and organisational measures to protect the security and integrity of the personal and non-personal information collected. This includes protection against unauthorised access as well as their accidental alteration, loss or destruction.</p> <p>In any case, the Property cannot guarantee the absolute security of the information collected meaning you should cooperate and use common sense at all times with regard to the information shared. For example by sharing the link of the reservation to other members of the same.</p> <p>In this case, the Property establishes time limits in the link to guarantee the security of the information, but in any case the collaboration of the guest is necessary to obtain the maximum level of security.</p> <h4>8.- Changes to the Privacy Policy</h4> <p>We may update this Privacy Policy in the future.</p> <p>If the changes are relevant, we will inform you about them by sending a notice to the email address that we may have and / or by placing a notice in a prominent place on the Services itself.</p> <h4>9.- Contact</h4> <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you may contact us at:</p> <div>Email: {{brandLegalEmail}}</div> <div>Address: {{brandLegalAddress}}</div> </div>',
